        "segments": [
          {
            "id": "s2_1",
            "speaker": "BOB",
            "text": "Right. And have you had any experience of leading cycle trips?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_2",
            "speaker": "MARGARET",
            "text": "Yes, I've led several bike tours in Africa. The trip to India that I had arranged to lead next month has now been cancelled, so when I saw you were advertising for tour leaders, I decided to apply.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_3",
            "speaker": "BOB",
            "text": "OK. Now we normally have two or three leaders on a trip, depending on the size of the group. Some tours are for very experienced cyclists, but we've got a tour coming up soon in Spain, which is proving so popular we need an additional leader. It's a cycling holiday for families. Would that suit you?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_4",
            "speaker": "MARGARET",
            "text": "It certainly would. I enjoy working with children, and I probable need some more experience before I go on a really challenging trip.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_5",
            "speaker": "BOB",
            "text": "That tour includes several teenagers: have you worked with that age group before?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_6",
            "speaker": "MARGARET",
            "text": "Yes, I'm a volunteer worker in a youth club, where I help people to improve their cycling skills. Before that I helped out in a cycling club where I taught beginners.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_7",
            "speaker": "BOB",
            "text": "Well that's great. Now the trip I mentioned is just for a fortnight, but there might be the possibility of leading other tours after that. Would that fit in with your plans?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_8",
            "speaker": "MARGARET",
            "text": "That's be fine. I'll be free for five months. My job is due to start on October the 2nd, and I'm available from May the 1st until late September.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_9",
            "speaker": "BOB",
            "text": "Good. Now is there anything I need to know about the food you eat? We usually have one or two people in the group who don't eat meat, or have some sort of food allergy, so we're always very careful about that.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
        ],
